From 9eb04b84d3cabafc0a71380b677643c81551a7f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yulun Zeng <yulunz@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 02:32:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 20/32] [DevTools] Gate emulation network overrides on
 MayAttachToURL

Emulation overrides (User-Agent, Accept-Language, and client hints) were
applied to requests without checking whether the session's client may
attach to the request URL. Gate them on MayAttachToURL, including for
downloads, and when a navigation redirects to a URL such a client may
not attach to, revert them to the overrides of sessions that may, or to
the original values.

Bug: 553259600
Change-Id: Ic1d0a7d703f5884b310c405a270a850edc75ae53
